[
  {
    "text": "每次出差旅行",
    "start_time": 0.0,
    "end_time": 1.154,
    "duration": 1.154
  },
  {
    "text": "是不是都在为带哪个吹风机发愁",
    "start_time": 1.154,
    "end_time": 3.846,
    "duration": 2.692
  },
  {
    "text": "酒店的吹风机风小还伤发",
    "start_time": 3.846,
    "end_time": 5.962,
    "duration": 2.115
  },
  {
    "text": "我真的会谢",
    "start_time": 5.962,
    "end_time": 6.923,
    "duration": 0.962
  },
  {
    "text": "还好被我挖到了这个出差神器",
    "start_time": 6.923,
    "end_time": 9.423,
    "duration": 2.5
  },
  {
    "text": "它折起来就比手机大一点点",
    "start_time": 9.423,
    "end_time": 11.731,
    "duration": 2.308
  },
  {
    "text": "放包里",
    "start_time": 11.731,
    "end_time": 12.308,
    "duration": 0.577
  },
  {
    "text": "行李箱里巨省地方",
    "start_time": 12.308,
    "end_time": 13.846,
    "duration": 1.538
  },
  {
    "text": "别看它小",
    "start_time": 13.846,
    "end_time": 14.615,
    "duration": 0.769
  },
  {
    "text": "11万转的风力可不是盖的",
    "start_time": 14.615,
    "end_time": 16.923,
    "duration": 2.308
  },
  {
    "text": "我这长头发几分钟就搞定了",
    "start_time": 16.923,
    "end_time": 19.231,
    "duration": 2.308
  },
  {
    "text": "而且它这个屏显调温我真的超爱",
    "start_time": 19.231,
    "end_time": 21.923,
    "duration": 2.692
  },
  {
    "text": "想要什么温度自己调",
    "start_time": 21.923,
    "end_time": 23.654,
    "duration": 1.731
  },
  {
    "text": "清清楚楚",
    "start_time": 23.654,
    "end_time": 24.423,
    "duration": 0.769
  },
  {
    "text": "经常出门的姐妹",
    "start_time": 24.423,
    "end_time": 25.769,
    "duration": 1.346
  },
  {
    "text": "这个颜值高又强悍的小东西",
    "start_time": 25.769,
    "end_time": 28.077,
    "duration": 2.308
  },
  {
    "text": "必须焊在你的行李箱里",
    "start_time": 28.077,
    "end_time": 30.0,
    "duration": 1.923
  }
]